Design of the control head was done in Solidworks 2010.
Slicing via Ultimaker Cura 5.
I printed using a Cocoon Create Touch (Wanhao Duplicator i3 plus)
The screw to retain the faceplate was just scavenged from surplus consumer electronics. Not too critical, just an approximately 2.5mm dia self tapping type screw.

I have included the STL files here for a one-stop-shop, but the full file set will be available at thingiverse.
